WEBVTT

00:15:26.838 --> 00:15:32.886
in the form of Maja Bosnic,
who is a public finance expert.

00:15:32.928 --> 00:15:35.180
She spoke recently at TEDWomen.

00:15:35.222 --> 00:15:37.057
Maja, what's your question?

00:15:37.057 --> 00:15:38.976
Maja Bosnic: Yes, thank you very much.

00:15:38.976 --> 00:15:42.729
So my question is basically
related to resistances.

00:15:42.729 --> 00:15:44.898
I work with public services,

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:48.485
and I work towards making them
more gender-responsive,

00:15:48.527 --> 00:15:52.072
so I know a thing or two
about resistances.

00:15:52.114 --> 00:15:56.451
So I wanted to ask you, what do you see
as the biggest resistances?

00:15:56.493 --> 00:16:00.288
And in which one,
or maybe some of these four